            0.086,
            0.344,
            0.103
          ],
          "content": "**Q.5 Find the years below.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.113,
            0.761,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": "a. From the present year, which year was it 150 years ago?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.14,
            0.762,
            0.158
          ],
          "content": "b. From the present year, which year was it 2200 years ago?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.167,
            0.446,
            0.184
          ],
          "content": "**Hint: Recall that there was no year 0.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.194,
            0.685,
            0.212
          ],
          "content": "c. What will be the year 320 years after 680 BCE?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.221,
            0.269,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": "Ans. c. -360 BCE"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.256,
            0.456,
            0.274
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Q.6 Complete the following sequences:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.283,
            0.599,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": "a. (–40), (–34), (–28), (–22), ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.31,
            0.526,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": "b. 3, 4, 2, 5, 1, 6, 0, 7,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.339,
            0.67,
            0.356
          ],
          "content": "c. \\_ , \\_ \\_, 12, 6, 1, (–3), (–6), \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, \\_"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.365,
            0.297,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. -16, -10, -4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.392,
            0.265,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": "b. -1,8, -2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.419,
            0.351,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": "c. 27, 19, … -8,-9,-9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.446,
            0.883,
            0.517
          ],
          "content": "**Q.7 Here are six integer cards: (+1), (+7), (+18), (–5), (–2), (–9). You can pick any of these and make an expression using addition(s) and subtraction(s). Here is an expression: (+18)+(+1)–(+7) – (–2) which gives a value (+14). Now, pick cards and make an expression such that its value is closer to (– 30).**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.526,
            0.574,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": "Ans. One of the ways is (-2) + (-9) – (+18) – (+1) = -30"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.553,
            0.882,
            0.588
          ],
          "content": "**Q.8 The sum of two positive integers is always positive but a (positive integer) – (positive integer) can be positive or negative. What about**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.59,
            0.371,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": "a. (positive) – (negative)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.479,
            0.59,
            0.688,
            0.607
          ],
          "content": "b. (positive) + (negative)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.608,
            0.375,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "c. (negative) + (negative)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.479,
            0.607,
            0.69,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": "d. (negative) – (negative)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.625,
            0.37,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": "e. (negative) – (positive)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.481,
            0.625,
            0.684,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": "f. (negative) + (positive)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.67,
            0.274,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": "Ans. a. positive"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.357,
            0.67,
            0.603,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": "b. can be positive or negative"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.181,
            0.688,
            0.277,
            0.705
          ],
          "content": "c. negative"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.359,
            0.687,
